  "name": "[GitHub] URL & Article Summarizer to Slack",
  "description": null,
  "active": false,
  "isArchived": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "199ba970-6aad-4ada-8625-7190071cc10a",
      "name": "Sticky Note 76d136c0",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -320,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## URL & Article Summarizer to Slack\n\nSend any article URL to this webhook and get an AI-generated summary posted to your Slack channel in seconds.\n\n### How it works\n1. A POST request arrives with a `url` field in the body\n2. The workflow fetches the page HTML\n3. OpenAI reads the content and writes a 3-5 sentence summary\n4. The summary posts to your Slack channel\n5. The webhook returns the summary as JSON\n\n### Setup\n1. Connect your OpenAI credential to the OpenAI Chat Model node\n2. Connect your Slack Bot credential to the Slack node\n3. Set your channel ID in \"Post Summary to Slack\"\n4. Activate and POST `{\"url\": \"https://example.com/article\"}` to the webhook URL\n\n### Customization\nSwap OpenAI for Anthropic or Gemini by replacing the Chat Model node. Edit the system message in \"Summarize Content\" to adjust length or tone.",
        "color": 1,
        "width": 300,
        "height": 500
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1c45a0bb-1e66-49ea-b722-f9a89d61d644",
      "name": "Sticky Note 92c31f15",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -50,
        -50
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Webhook Input\nReceives `{\"url\": \"...\"}` and normalizes the field for downstream nodes.",
        "color": 7,
        "width": 300,
        "height": 200
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "49082e02-8c42-406c-b9d0-d6cc8e503328",
      "name": "Sticky Note 2286f04d",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -50,
        -50
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Fetch & Summarize\nFetches the page HTML and passes up to 10,000 characters to OpenAI for summarization.",
        "color": 7,
        "width": 300,
        "height": 200
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7589f2be-035a-4484-8a87-eac714e65dfc",
      "name": "Receive Summarize Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        112
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "summarize",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "webhookId": "2bdc29e3-15fe-48ff-8017-9c26b8aa28fe"
    },
    {
      "id": "94cc41ce-68c1-481b-a308-6dd02bf26401",
      "name": "Extract URL",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        224,
        112
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "field-url",
              "name": "url",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.url ?? $json.url ?? \"\" }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8f575ea5-7810-4141-a096-f9680e34e9cb",
      "name": "Fetch Page Content",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        448,
        112
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "0c1268d9-9664-45a4-9da0-5f803584e8ac",
      "name": "Summarize Content",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        672,
        112
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "systemMessage": "You are a content summarizer. Extract the main article text from the HTML and write a clear, concise summary. Ignore navigation, ads, footers, and boilerplate.",
        "text": "=Summarize the following web page in 3-5 sentences. Focus on key points and main insights.\n\nURL: {{ $(\"Extract URL\").item.json.url }}\n\nContent:\n{{ $json.data?.substring(0, 10000) ?? \"No content available.\" }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "841d9e46-7f2a-4091-8362-41191e43f5f0",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        752,
        336
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "3d6f086e-c4f2-47cc-a865-632a05a6b86c",
      "name": "Post Summary to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        1024,
        112
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_SLACK_CHANNEL_ID"
        },
        "text": "=*Article Summary*\n:link: <{{ $(\"Extract URL\").item.json.url }}|View Article>\n\n{{ $json.output }}",
        "otherOptions": {
          "includeLinkToWorkflow": false
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Slack account"
        }
      },
      "webhookId": "02c8dc78-738b-4b43-ad39-fb900466a39a"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc48fd14-8656-4b13-bc14-d3bc42dbb94a",
      "name": "Return Summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        1248,
        112
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"success\": true, \"url\": $(\"Extract URL\").item.json.url, \"summary\": $(\"Summarize Content\").item.json.output } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      }
    }
  ],
